(7510182, 1197497, 167587, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Composition: 6 - Technical: 5 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 4 - Challenge: 2 - Overall Score: 3 - (weighted - NOT a calculated average)<br/> <br/><i>Note: <a href="//www.artroflmao.com/dpc/voting_notes/index.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Click for info</a></i> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Art: Thank you for your comments. As I gazed across the farmland and tree lines of the midwest, I could think of nothing else other than "this should not be here." So unnatural to the landscape.<br/>It appeared almost violent, and was certainly "unappealing." That was my take and motivation for the shot, and I''m at least glad that''s what came across. YMMV</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Composition: 6 - Technical: 5 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 4 - Challenge: 2 - Overall Score: 3 - (weighted - NOT a calculated average) Note: Click for info   Art: Thank you for your comments. As I gazed across the farmland and tree lines of the midwest, I could think of nothing else other than "this should not be here." So unnatural to the landscape.It appeared almost violent, and was certainly "unappealing." That was my take and motivation for the shot, and I''m at least glad that''s what came across. YMMV', '2017-04-21 10:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
